      "value": "From looking at the other bug reports and /r/VRChat it seems like the issue started yesterday. \n\nYour unfavoriting gets sent to the server, but the client doesn't get updated.\n\nI suspect that restarting VRChat might force the list to be updated, but if you try this once or twice, you'll likely agree that this is not a good work-around.",
